  baseData:
    id: Artefact_Horse
    itemName: Paperweight in the shape of a horse
    itemDescription: "Cast in silver, this elegant standing horse may have served
      as a paperweight on a scholar\u2019s desk. The figure reflects both the refined
      metalwork and cultivated aesthetics valued by intellectuals of the period."
    itemIcon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 0abd31fb384d64b42912f3299d32114f, type: 3}
    exclude: 0
  stickyNoteTexts:
  - "Here\u2019s another Chinese artifact! A beauty... Something I would personally
    have in my house, to be honest :)\n\n-Ms. Maya"
  - "p.s So your mom is Tara Arkana? I\u2019ve heard of her from an excavation project
    back in the early 2000s... Her dedication to represent Indonesia internationally
    was so inspiring for me as a young historian back then!"
